  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcPivotGrid .NET: the pivot engine, every aggregate, date grouping, filters, drill-down, format rules, export, the field list, the headless renderer and the WinForms, WPF and Avalonia views. Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a Commercial licence. Calculated fields, show values as, Top N, layout persistence and the pivot chart (the chart table and the field button bar) are not included in the Community edition. https://www.esegece.com",
